OL,3,ANvidia shares slide as Trump's role in
OL,4,AJensen Huang's comeback questioned by
OL,5,AUS politicians
OL,6,
OL,7,FShares in Nvidia dipped on Tuesday as
OL,8,FUS politicans questioned President
OL,9,FDonald Trump's role in the return of
OL,10,FJensen Huang as chief executive.
OL,12,FHuang was handed back his job at the AI
OL,13,Fmicrochip maker on Monday less than two
OL,14,Fweeks after he was forced to resign
OL,15,Ffollowing the revelations of extra
OL,16,Fmarital affairs, one of which was with
OL,17,Fa suspected Chinese spy.
OL,19,FTrump has said he played a big role in
OL,20,Fthe 63-year-old's reinstatment, which
OL,21,Fhas led to questions and backlash from
OL,22,FUS lawmakers.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
